<title>UK: American Airlines to up ex-UK air cargo rat.</title>
<headline>American Airlines to up ex-UK air cargo rat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Airlines, part of AMR Corp, will increase its UK-United States air cargo rates by an average of five percent from May 1, its UK sales manager Steve Buckerfield told Reuters.</p>
<p>The market was strengthening after a slow start to the year and by May would be able to support a rate rise that would partially offset continuing rising costs, he added.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
